sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Владелец / запрос
    participant UI as Branding editor
    participant API as PATCH branding
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Owner->>UI: Save draft
    Note over UI: Client validation; capture draft; lock settings + Save
    UI->>API: PATCH
    alt Нет действующей session
        API-->>UI: 401 до body read
    else Origin / type / body / fields invalid
        API-->>UI: 403 / 415 / 413 / 400 без write transaction
    else Request valid
        API->>DB: withAccount; locked owned active lookup
        alt Foreign / missing / inactive
            DB-->>API: Нет видимой строки
            API-->>UI: 404 без branding
        else Stored JSON не объект
            DB-->>API: Non-object value
            API-->>UI: 409; без normalization write
        else UPDATE permission revoked / DB fault
            API->>DB: UPDATE validated patch
            DB-->>API: Permission/error
            API->>DB: ROLLBACK
            API-->>UI: 503; no success payload
        end
    end
    UI-->>Owner: Unlock прежний draft; focus error summary; linked field errors
    Note over UI,API: Network ambiguity не обещает exactly-once
